        "nobel_worthiness": "Antisense correction of SMN2 splicing converted a lethal genetic childhood disease into a treatable condition and established a major therapeutic principle.",
        "attribution": "The two credited investigators represent complementary mechanistic and therapeutic contributions to the antisense approach.",
        "maturity": "Clinical efficacy and the underlying splice-modulation mechanism have had substantial time for confirmation.",
