        "nobel_worthiness": "The unfolded protein response revealed a fundamental system by which cells sense and respond to endoplasmic-reticulum stress, with broad biological and disease relevance.",
        "attribution": "Mori and Walter form a clear, appropriately limited attribution for defining central UPR signaling mechanisms.",
        "maturity": "The pathway has been deeply validated across organisms and integrated into cell biology over decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Its broad disease relevance does not by itself establish which downstream translational implications are causal or clinically actionable."
